  "term": "democracy",
  "definition": "Democracy is, in its basic sense, rule by the people. More specifically, it refers to a form of government in which control rests with the general body of the people rather than with wealth or privileged rank, and it is also sometimes used more loosely for the mass of the people themselves.",
